<title>USA: Iwerks Entertainment co-chairman resigns.</title>
<headline>Iwerks Entertainment co-chairman resigns.</headline>
<dateline>BURBANK, Calif. 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iwerks Entertainment Inc said Friday that Director and Co-Chairman Paula Douglass has resigned.</p>
<p>Her resignation was effective March 6.</p>
<p>No reason was given for her departure, and the company was not immediately available to comment.</p>
</text>
